{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Huntress Saber survives the client dismount packet accompanying damage and healing (#210)",
  "contract": [
    "Huntress Saber 524643 says casting does not dismount its Starcaller and permits offensive",
    "casts while moving. Its helper 704772 lasts 30 seconds and the lifecycle uses mount display",
    "9991. Frostbolt must damage a target while moving and Lesser Heal must heal the wounded",
    "caster, including the CMSG_CANCEL_MOUNT_AURA the client sends alongside mounted casts.",
    "Observe the native mount display rather than only the retained dummy aura. A Starcaller",
    "on an ordinary Brown Horse must still dismount, and explicit Saber aura cancellation must work."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
